/* Biscuit — English string table (base language).
 *
 * Keys are semantic identifiers defined in StringKey.swift. Diagnostics are
 * deliberately NOT in here: errno text, tool output and protocol reasons stay
 * English and unlocalised so they remain searchable and comparable in bug
 * reports.
 *
 * Placeholders must be preserved exactly. `%1$@`-style positional forms are
 * used wherever a translation might need a different word order.
 */

